flowchart TD
    A["增量演进（Incremental changes）：补丁与环境累积隐性状态"] --> B["定时冷启动（Scheduled cold rebuild）：从规范定义从零重建"]
    B --> C{"重建是否一次通过？（Clean cold pass?）"}
    C -- "未通过：显式失败" --> D["暴露隐藏依赖（Hidden dependencies surface）"]
    D --> E["修复规范定义（Patch the canonical definition）"]
    E --> B
    C -- "通过" --> F["确认无漂移（Drift caught or absent）"]
    F --> G["回到增量工作（Resume incremental work）"]
    G -. "漂移再次累积" .-> B
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class B,E core;
    class C,D gate;
    class A,F,G out;
